    "%@, %@ to %@, %@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "A sentence describing a flight, including the flight number, departure and arrival cities, and the current status of the flight. The fourth argument is the string “Timetable only”, the string “Scheduled”, the string “On time”, the string “Delayed”, the string “Early”, the string “Check-in open”, the string “Boarding”, the string “Gate closed”, the string “Departed”, the string “In the air”, the string “Landing soon”, the string “Landed”, the string “Arrived”, the string “Cancelled” or the string “Diverted”. The fifth argument is the string “No live updates yet. These are the timetable times.”, the string “Running %arg min late”, the string “Leaving %arg min early”, the string “Leaving on time”, the string “Check-in is open”, the value of the localized string key “Boarding now at gate %@”, the string “Boarding now”, the string “The gate has closed.”, the string “Landing about %arg min late”, the string “In the air”, the string “At the gate”, the string “Landed”, the string “This flight was cancelled” or the string “This flight was diverted”.",
